# The settings window loads these through GObject introspection, which shlibs cannot see.
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), hicolor-icon-theme, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Ngó Sen for Wayland, a Vietnamese input method without fcitx5 or IBus
 Ngó Sen for Wayland types Vietnamese on compositors that offer
 input-method-v2, such as niri, Sway and Hyprland, without fcitx5 or IBus.
 A small daemon types through the Ngó Sen core and shows a tray icon with
 the typing modes. It shares its settings with the other Ngó Sen editions.
